<section class="band--pale faq">
  <div class="wrap narrow">
    <h2>The other questions</h2>
    <details><summary>How can we pay?</summary><p>Cash or bank transfer. If you are paying from abroad, make sure the full amount arrives before your child's first day. Bank and transfer charges are paid by the family.</p></details>
    <details><summary>When is each payment due?</summary><p>If you pay the whole year, by 20 May for the Early Bird price or by 30 June for the Standard price. If you pay by quarter, by 28 July, 8 October, 17 December and 22 March. Meals and transport can be paid for the year or by quarter. The dates are also on the <a href="{{ '/families/schedule/#calendar' | url }}">calendar</a>.</p></details>
    <details><summary>What if we join partway through the year?</summary><p>You pay from your child's first day. We work out that quarter's tuition from the number of class days left in it.</p></details>
    <details><summary>What is your refund policy?</summary><p>If you paid for the full year and your child leaves before 18 December 2026, we refund the equivalent of the Quarter 3 tuition. Quarterly payments are not refunded. Meals are refundable with 15 days' notice. Transport follows the tuition rule for families who paid the full year and is not refundable on quarterly payments. The admission fee is not refundable.</p></details>
  </div>
</section>

